{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece of Worlds is a unique sokoban-style puzzle game set in a whimsical world made of jigsaw puzzle pieces.<br>In this game, you're not just pushing blocks\u2014you can <strong>detach and reattach pieces of the stage itself</strong> to forge new paths and solve puzzles in creative ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each piece holds meaning, mechanisms, and secrets.<br>As you rearrange the pieces and progress through the puzzles, a hidden truth behind this tiny world begins to unfold.<br>Can you complete the puzzle of this mysterious world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912130/extras/a8220272ebe1cbd73147567fc7bc6637.poster.avif?t=1753995136\" width=588 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912130/extras/a8220272ebe1cbd73147567fc7bc6637.webm?t=1753995136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912130/extras/a8220272ebe1cbd73147567fc7bc6637.mp4?t=1753995136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique mechanic where you rearrange stage pieces to solve puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compact design with about 1 hour of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 handcrafted puzzles with creative twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious story hidden within the world as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming and warm visual design</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912130?t=1753995136","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912130?t=1753995136",